  <tr>
    <th>Q1</th>
    <th nowrap="nowrap"><div align="left">How to generate Beneficiary/branch wise report ? </div></th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Ans:</td>
    <td>Clink on Report button from the menu and then Click on underlined value of <em>No of prj. columns </em>to generate beneficiary/branch wise detailed report in excel format</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th nowrap="nowrap">Q2.</th>
    <th nowrap="nowrap"><div align="left">Zone /Region wise Report Not showing ? </div></th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Ans:</td>
    <td>By default the report will display in state-wise order. In case Zone-wise /Region wise reports are required, a list of branch IFSC code along with branch name, Zone/ Region in excel format may be sent to this office by e-mail.</td>
  </tr>
